[
  {
    "content_id": "10060001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我是耶穌基督的使徒彼得，寫信給寄居在本都、加拉太、加帕多迦、亞細亞、庇推尼各地的上帝選民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你們按照父上帝預先定好的旨意蒙了揀選，藉著聖靈得以聖潔，好順服耶穌基督，並靠祂的血得到潔淨。 願上帝多多賜給你們恩典和平安！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;願頌讚歸於我們主耶穌基督的父上帝！祂懷著極大的憐憫，透過耶穌基督從死裡復活，使我們獲得重生，有活潑的盼望，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;可以承受那不會朽壞、不會腐爛、不會衰殘、為你們存留在天上的產業。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你們這些因信而蒙上帝用大能保守的人，必能得到那已經預備好、在末世要顯明的救恩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;為此，即使現今你們必須暫時在百般試煉中忍受痛苦，也要滿懷喜樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;這樣，你們的信心經過考驗後，比那經過火煉仍會壞掉的金子更加寶貴，使你們可以在耶穌基督顯現時得到稱讚、榮耀和尊貴。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你們雖然沒有見過祂，卻愛祂；雖然現在看不見祂，卻信祂，並且有無法形容、充滿榮耀的喜樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;因為你們得到了信心帶來的果效，就是你們的靈魂得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;有關這救恩，那些預言恩典要臨到你們的眾先知早已詳細尋求和查考了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;基督的靈曾在他們心中指示他們，預言基督要受苦，然後得榮耀。他們便詳細查考這些事在何時、何境況下發生。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;他們得到啟示，知道他們傳講這些事不是為了自己，而是為了你們。現在，那些靠著從天上差來的聖靈向你們傳福音的人，已經將這些事傳給你們了。連天使也渴望把這些事看個明白。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;所以，要預備好你們的心，謹慎自律，專心盼望耶穌基督顯現時要帶給你們的恩典。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你們既是順服的兒女，就不要再像從前無知的時候那樣放縱私慾。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;那呼召你們的是聖潔的，你們的一切行為也要聖潔。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;因為聖經上說：「你們要聖潔，因為我是聖潔的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;既然你們稱呼那位按各人的行為公正無私地審判人的上帝為父，就應該存著敬畏的心過你們在世上寄居的日子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;要知道，你們從傳統的、沒有意義的生活中被救贖出來，不是靠金銀等會朽壞的東西，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;而是靠無瑕無疵的代罪羔羊基督的寶血。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;基督是上帝在創世以前預先揀選的，卻在這末世為你們顯現。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你們藉著基督信了使祂從死裡復活、賜祂榮耀的上帝，所以，你們的信心和盼望都在於上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;你們既因順服真理，潔淨了自己的心，能夠真誠地愛弟兄姊妹，就當以清潔的心彼此切實相愛。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;你們獲得重生，不是藉著會腐爛的種子，而是藉著不會腐爛的種子——上帝活潑永存的道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;因為 「芸芸眾生盡如草， 榮華紛縟草上花； 草必枯乾花必殘，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 1:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;唯有主道永長存。」 這道就是傳給你們的福音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;因此，你們要除去一切惡毒、欺詐、虛偽、嫉妒和毀謗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;要像初生的嬰兒愛慕奶一樣渴慕純淨的靈奶，好不斷成長，直到完全得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因為你們嘗過主恩的滋味是何等甘美。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;主是活石，雖然被人棄絕，卻被上帝揀選、視為寶貴。你們來到祂面前，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;也如同活石，被用來建造屬靈的宮殿，好做聖潔的祭司，藉著耶穌基督獻上蒙上帝悅納的靈祭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;因為聖經上說： 「看啊，我在錫安放了一塊石頭，一塊蒙揀選的寶貴房角石， 信靠祂的人必不會蒙羞。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;所以，這石頭對你們信的人而言，是寶貴的；但對那些不信的人而言，卻是： 「工匠丟棄的石頭， 已成了房角石。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;也是： 「絆腳石和使人跌倒的磐石。」 他們跌倒是因為他們不順服真道，這早已註定了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;但你們是蒙揀選的族群，是君尊的祭司，是聖潔的國度，是上帝的子民，為了要宣揚上帝的美德。祂曾呼召你們離開黑暗，進入祂奇妙的光明。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;從前你們不是上帝的子民，現在卻作了祂的子民；從前你們未蒙憐憫，現在卻蒙了憐憫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;親愛的弟兄姊妹，你們是客旅，是寄居的，我勸你們要禁戒與靈魂為敵的邪情私慾。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你們在異教徒當中要品行端正。這樣，儘管他們毀謗你們是作惡的人，但看見你們的善行，也會在主來的日子把榮耀歸給上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;為主的緣故，你們要服從人間的一切權柄，不管是居首位的君王，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;還是被君王派來賞善罰惡的官員。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;因為上帝的旨意是要你們行善，使那些愚昧無知的人啞口無言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你們是自由的人，但不要以自由為藉口去犯罪作惡，要作上帝的奴僕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;要尊重所有的人，愛主內的弟兄姊妹，敬畏上帝，尊敬君王。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;你們做奴僕的，要存敬畏的心順服主人，不但順服那良善溫和的，也要順服那兇暴的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;因為你們若為了讓良心對得起上帝而忍受冤屈之苦，必蒙上帝悅納。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;如果你們犯罪受責打，能夠忍耐，有什麼功勞呢？但如果你們因行善而受苦，還能忍耐，就是上帝所喜悅的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你們蒙召也是為此，因為基督也為你們受過苦，給你們留下榜樣，叫你們可以追隨祂的腳步。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;祂沒有犯罪，口中也沒有詭詐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;祂被辱罵也不還口，被迫害也不揚言報復，只把自己交託給按公義施行審判的上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;祂被釘在十字架上，親身擔當了我們的罪，使我們向著罪死了，可以過公義的生活。因祂所受的鞭傷，你們得到了醫治。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;從前你們好像是迷路的羊，現在卻歸向了你們靈魂的牧人和監護者。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:1-2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1-2</sup>&nbsp;照樣，你們作妻子的要順服自己的丈夫。這樣，即使丈夫不信從真道，也會因為看見妻子貞潔和敬虔的品行而被無聲地感化。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你們不要注重外表的妝飾，像編頭髮、戴金飾或穿華麗的衣服，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;要以溫柔、嫺靜這些永不褪色的內在美為妝飾，這是上帝所看重的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;從前那些仰賴上帝的聖潔婦女，都以這些來妝飾自己，並順服自己的丈夫，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;正如撒拉順服亞伯拉罕，稱他為主人。你們如果做對的事，不怕恐嚇，就是撒拉的女兒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你們作丈夫的也一樣，要按情理與妻子共同生活，因為她們比你們軟弱。要敬重她們，因為她們和你們一同承受生命之恩。這樣，你們的禱告就可以暢通無阻了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;總而言之，你們要同心合意，互相關懷，彼此相愛，仁慈謙卑。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;不要以惡報惡，以辱罵還辱罵，反要祝福對方，因為這是你們蒙召的目的，好叫你們蒙福。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;聖經上說： 「若有人熱愛生命， 渴望幸福， 就要舌頭不出惡言， 嘴唇不說詭詐的話。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;要棄惡行善，竭力追求和睦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;因為主的眼睛看顧義人， 祂的耳朵垂聽他們的祈求。 但主必嚴懲作惡之人。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;如果你們熱心行善，有誰會害你們呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;就算你們為義受苦，也是有福的。不要害怕別人的恐嚇，也不要驚慌，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;要從心裡尊基督為主。如果有人問起你們心中的盼望，你們要隨時準備答覆，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;但態度要溫和恭敬，存無愧的良心。這樣，那些對你們在基督裡的好品行妄加誣衊的人會自覺羞愧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;如果上帝的旨意是要你們因行善而受苦，也總比你們因作惡而受苦強。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;因為基督也曾一次為罪受苦，以無罪之身代替不義之人，為要領你們到上帝面前。祂的肉體雖被處死，但祂藉著聖靈復活了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;祂還藉著聖靈向那些被監禁的靈魂傳道，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;就是從前在挪亞造方舟、上帝耐心等候人們悔改的時代中那些不肯信的人。當時進入方舟，從洪水中得救的人很少，只有八個人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;這水預表的洗禮現在藉著耶穌基督的復活也拯救了你們，這洗禮不是要除掉肉體的污穢，而是求在上帝面前有無愧的良心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 3:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;基督已經升到天上，坐在上帝的右邊，眾天使、掌權的、有能力的都服從了祂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;既然基督在肉體上受過苦，你們也要懷著同樣的心志，因為肉體受過苦的人已經與罪斷絕了關係，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;可以在今後的生活中不再隨從人的私慾，只服從上帝的旨意。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你們從前長期沉溺於異教徒的嗜好——淫亂、縱慾、醉酒、狂歡、宴樂和可憎的偶像崇拜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;如今你們不再和他們同流合污，他們覺得奇怪，就用惡言毀謗你們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;他們將來必須向審判活人和死人的主交賬。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;正因如此，福音也曾傳給已死的人。這樣，他們的肉體雖然像世人一樣受了審判，他們的靈魂卻可以靠上帝活著。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;萬物的盡頭快到了。因此，你們要謹慎自律，警醒禱告。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;最重要的是要彼此真誠相愛，因為愛可以遮蓋許多罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;要互相接待，不發怨言，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;按著自己所得的恩賜彼此服侍，作上帝各樣恩典的好管家。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;能講道的，要按著上帝的話去講；能服侍人的，要本著上帝所賜的力量去服侍。這樣，上帝會藉著耶穌基督在一切事上得到榮耀。 願榮耀和權能都歸給祂，直到永永遠遠。阿們！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;親愛的弟兄姊妹，若有火一般的試煉臨到你們，不要覺得奇怪，好像發生了什麼不尋常的事，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;反倒要歡喜，因為你們是與基督一起受苦。這樣，你們在祂的榮耀顯現時可以和祂一同歡喜快樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;如果你們為基督的緣故受辱罵，就有福了！因為上帝榮耀的靈常住在你們身上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你們誰也不可因殺人、偷盜、作惡或管閒事而受苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;若是為了作基督徒而受苦，不要覺得羞恥，要因這身分歸榮耀給上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;因為時候到了，審判要先從上帝的家開始。如果審判從我們開始，那些不信從上帝福音的人又會有怎樣的結局呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;如果義人得救尚且不易，不敬虔的人和罪人會有什麼下場呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;所以，照上帝旨意受苦的人要繼續專心行善，將自己的靈魂交託給那位信實的造物主。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我作為長老，也作為基督受苦的見證人和同享將要顯明之榮耀的人，勸你們中間作長老的：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;務要牧養上帝託付給你們的羊群，按上帝的旨意照顧他們，不是出於勉強，不是為了謀利，而是出於甘心，出於熱誠。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;不要轄制託付給你們的羊群，而是要做群羊的榜樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;等到大牧長顯現的時候，你們必得到永不衰殘的榮耀冠冕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你們年輕的要順服年長的，大家都要存謙卑的心彼此服侍。因為上帝阻擋驕傲的人，恩待謙卑的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;所以你們要在上帝大能的手下謙卑，時候到了，祂必提升你們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你們要把一切憂慮卸給祂，因為祂眷顧你們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你們務要謹慎、警醒，因為你們的仇敵魔鬼好像咆哮的獅子四處遊走，尋找可以吞吃的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你們要以堅定的信心抵擋牠，要知道世界各地的弟兄姊妹在遭受同樣的苦難。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;你們忍受短暫的苦難之後，廣施恩典、在基督裡呼召你們享受祂永遠榮耀的上帝必親自復興你們，使你們剛強、篤定、堅立。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;願權能歸給祂，直到永永遠遠。阿們！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;在忠心的弟兄西拉的幫助下，我簡單地寫了這封信勸勉你們，並證明這是上帝真實的恩典。你們務要在這恩典上站穩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;在巴比倫和你們一同蒙揀選的教會問候你們，我的兒子馬可也問候你們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前書 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你們要以愛心彼此親吻問候。 願平安歸給你們所有在基督裡的人！</p>"
  }
]